---

STEP 2 - GO TO GITHUB 
1. Open Chrome on your phone
2. Go to github.com
3. Login
4. Open your school project - the one with index.html
5. You should see your files: index.html, style.css, etc.

Tell me &quot;I am in GitHub&quot; when you are there.

---

STEP 3 - UPLOAD THE PHOTO 
1. In GitHub, tap Add file (top right)
2. Tap Upload files
3. Tap choose your files
4. Select the photo you saved in Step 1
5. VERY IMPORTANT: Rename it to this exactly:
2025-computer-students.jpg
No capital letters, no spaces.
6. Tap Commit changes (green button)

Tell me &quot;photo uploaded&quot;

---

STEP 4 - REPLACE index.html 
1. In GitHub, tap on index.html
2. Tap pencil icon ✏️ (Edit)
3. Press and hold, tap Select All, tap Delete - page becomes empty
4. Go back to our chat, copy the FULL HTML I sent you before
5. Paste it in that empty page
6. Tap Commit changes

Tell me &quot;html replaced&quot;

---

STEP 5 - MAKE IT LIVE IN RENDER 
1. Open render.com
2. Open your website
3. Tap Manual Deploy
4. Tap Clear build cache &amp; deploy
5. Wait 2 minutes, refresh your website

Your photo post 2025 Computer Students will appear.

